  "description": "Fuselage: Polished aluminum, unpainted. Cheatlines: Three equal stripes along the windows, blue (the windows in it), white, red, running from the nose to just behind the rear door; straight in side view, red and white running off the nose, blue starting just behind the cockpit windows (they sit on bare metal, a hairline of blue under them not drawn). Tail: Polished fin with the AA eagle: a red 'A' and a blue 'A' side by side, thinly edged in white, a blue eagle diving between their tops. Engines: Silver. Winglets: Silver. Titles: 'American' in red upright sans (Helvetica) over the forward cabin, above the stripes, thinly edged in white. Artwork: none. Colors hex: approximate.",
